        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4912dadc-eade-439c-b1fa-b635fd560b09",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# Execute MyTestStrategyBotTrigger\n\nDescribes the execution of the custom strategy bot trigger and logs the outcome of that trigger action."
    },
    {
